<subpara id="X39400000R4015C_12" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___00002PU00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), read the freeze data. Freeze data records part of the engine operating condition when the malfunction occurred, and this information is useful when troubleshooting.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400000R4015C_13" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X39400000R4015C_13_0018" proc-id="RM0550J___00002Q000000">
<scantool type="4"/>
<testtitle>Read TaSCAN Data (Throttle Sensor No.1 Opening Angle / Throttle Sensor No.2 Voltage)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Apply the parking brake and chock the wheels.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), select [ECU Data Monitor] following the screen display.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Read [Throttle Sensor No.1 Opening Angle] and [Throttle Sensor No.2 Voltage] with the accelerator pedal fully closed.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Start the engine.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Firmly depress the brake pedal with your left foot and shift to the D position.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Read [Throttle Sensor No.1 Opening Angle] and [Throttle Sensor No.2 Voltage] with the accelerator pedal fully open.</ptxt>
